extends /specs/products/aha/page-structure/structure/templates/structure/layout-tmpl.jade

block content

    section.source_section
        h2 Buttons variations

        h3 Default with hover and focus effects button
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `btn btn-primary` to the button item.
        .source_example
            button.btn.btn--primary I am a primary button

        h3 Inverse with hover and focus effects button
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `btn btn-inverse` to the button item.
        .source_example
            button.btn.btn--inverse I am an inverse button


        h3 Danger with hover and focus effects button
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `btn btn-danger` to the button item.
        .source_example
            button.btn.btn--danger I am a danger button


        h3 Transparent with hover and focus effects button
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `btn btn-transparent` to the button item.
        .source_example
            button.btn.btn--transparent I am a transparent button


        h3 Outline with hover and focus effects button
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `btn btn-outline` to the button item.
        .source_example
            button.btn.btn--outline I am an outline button

        h3 Disabled Outline with hover and focus effects button
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `btn btn-outline` to the button item.
        .source_example
            button.btn.btn--outline(disabled="disabled") I am a disabled outline button


        h3 Disabled button
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `disabled` attribute to make the button disabled.
        .source_example
            button.btn(disabled="disabled") I am a disabled button

        h3  Meta Journal Button
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added link class `btn btn--inverse btn--journal-meta`
        .source_example
            a.btn.btn--inverse.btn--journal-meta Button

    | #{''}